  "Scenes.Amilyscene.AmilyKidMeeting.KidsAreVisiting": "[pg][say:It's our kids, [name], they're visiting! They sent a messenger ahead--apparently the village they're building is doing well enough that they have the time to come here. Oh, I just can't wait to see their cute little faces.] She pauses for a moment, struck by a thought. [say:Oh, but they're probably not so little anymore. Well that's fine, it'll be nice to see them grown, too. But oh, what if they don't remember us?] She continues oscillating in this fashion, but you can tell that it's just nerves."
