  "Scenes.Amilyscene.AmilyKidMeetingGo.SeatsAroundFire": "[pg]The lot of you move over to the camp proper, taking seats around the fire in the center, many of your children making use of convenient rocks, logs, barrels, and other miscellanea for furniture. You have a grand time talking with all of them, surprised at the breadth of personality and experience you find there despite them all having come from the same source."
