  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DateNightFirstTime.UrtaCrestfallenMumble": "[say: Oh, [his]... mate...] Urta mumbles, looking a little crestfallen at the admission. Her emerald eyes light up with an idea while a mischievous grin spreads over her {0}. Before she can act on it, you request her to allow the two of you through the gates, interrupting whatever tricks the clever fox has planned. She retrieves the corruption-detecting gem she once used on you and gives Amily a quick sweep. When the gem emits a white glow, Urta gives an authoritative nod and calls for the gates to be opened.[pg]"
