  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DugEnough.EmbraceCalmerManner": "[pg]Eventually, you fall into each other's arms again and embrace in a much calmer manner. Still riding a rather sexual high, you're caught by surprise when she very suddenly flicks you in the nose. The sharp pain causes you to exclaim, holding a hand against your face as Amily meets your confused gaze with a smirk."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DugEnough.MoansOvertakeWetSounds": "[say: Aah... Aaaah! Soo... Deep!] Amily's moans overtake the wet sounds of rubbing flesh as the two of you pause at the end of your thrust and enjoy the lovely sexuality of just how roughly you're fucking each other. With each thrust, you bulge her stomach in and out with the shape of your massive dick. Her tongue hangs from her mouth between words, drooling onto her chest, and her hands hold tightly against you through the skin of her belly each time it stretches outward. In no time at all she's gone from pushing you away to pulling you in, even going so far as to wrap her legs around your back.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DugEnough.PullOutAmilyGrips": "As you begin to pull out, Amily's hands find a firm grasp against your wrists and weakly try to push them away while her belly deflates with its intruders' exit. [say: What did I say...?! You can't...] she protests as she tries to force you out. When you thrust back inside, however, the fingers lose their hold in time with a high-pitched grunt from their owner and her belly stretches out once again.[pg]"
