  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DugEnough.ScoldsNotSoDeep": "[say: I told you not to go so deep!] she scolds you lightly, adding momentarily that, [say: I couldn't imagine it'd feel that good, though...] and offering the same spot a kiss. You embrace in the afterglow for some time later, eager to do this again some time."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DugEnough.SquealsGaspingBreath": "[say: You're reaching so deep! You'll- drive me- aaah...! Crazy...!] she squeals, gasping for breath between each thrust with a slutty expression. Between the mouse-girl's tight body and the expression on her drooling face, you quickly approach your own limits and a grunt escapes your lips as you struggle to draw breath for a moment."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DugEnough.ThoughtPassesStretched": "The thought quickly passes, however; your lover's already being nicely-stretched, and you can't spare any time to idle thoughts with the heat building in your groin. It takes a few moments to gain your bearings against the unbelievable tightness of the mouse-girl's resisting folds, but you grasp her firmly by the waist and begin to move. If she didn't like it, you could make it feel good for her soon enough.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DyeAmilyHairOrFur.AsksAboutHairColor": "You ask if she's ever thought about changing the color of her hair ([horsecock]- fur, you amend yourself/NOTHING AT ALL)--and if she does, you have a possible new color for her to try."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DyeAmilyHairOrFur.ContemplativeNewLook": "[pg]She looks contemplative. [say: I always did kind of want to try a new look. Sure, let's give it a shot!] She smiles."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.DyeAmilyHairOrFur.HeadToStreamDye": "[pg]The two of you head to the stream, where Amily strips down and dives into the water, to ensure she's scrubbed as clean as possible. When she swims back, you join her in the water's edge, where you open the bottle of dye and begin the long process of massaging it into her ([horsecock] fur. You worry for a moment that there's not enough to cover her, but, at the end, you manage to make it work/hair). Helping her wash the excess out with the cool water, you both leave the water, where Amily slowly twirls around to let you admire her new (dyecolor) ([horsecock]fur/'do). Quite pleased with it herself, she grabs her (clothesdescript) and wanders off back to camp, with you following her."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.AdmitHumanAsk": "You admit that, yes, you are a human, and then ask her why she remains here in this empty wasteland of a settlement.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.AdmitHumanAskAgain": "You admit that, yes, you are a human, and then ask her why she remains here in this empty wasteland of a settlement.[pg]"
