  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.AreYouQuestion": "Are you "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.AreYouQuestionAgain": "Are you "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.AreYouQuestionFourth": "Are you "
