  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ButYouHaveBoobs": "[say: But you have boobs... and I don't see a crotch-bulge,] she says, sounding almost petulant. [say: I don't smell a vagina, either... Wait, are you telling me you don't have either pair of genitals?] she asks, clearly dumbfounded.[pg]"
