  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.CreatureCorneredYou": "The creature that has cornered you is clearly of the same race as Jojo, though notably a female member of his species. Her {0} with dust, but you can still easily make out its {1} color. Her limbs and midriff are wiry, hardened as much by meals that are less than frequent as by constant exercise and physical exertion. Her buttocks are non-existent, and her breasts can't be any larger than an A-cup. She wears a tattered pair of pants and an equally ragged-looking shirt. A very large and wicked-looking dagger--more of a short sword really--is strapped to her hip, and she is menacing you with a blowpipe.[pg]"
