  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.CreatureCorneredYouThird": "The creature that has cornered you is clearly of the same race as Jojo, though notably a female member of his species. Her {0} with dust, but you can still easily make out its {1} color. Her limbs and midriff are wiry, hardened as much by meals that are less than frequent as by constant exercise and physical exertion. Her buttocks are non-existent, and her breasts can't be any larger than an A-cup. She wears a tattered pair of pants and an equally ragged-looking shirt. A very large and wicked-looking dagger--more of a short sword really--is strapped to her hip, and she is menacing you with a blowpipe.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.CrossesArmsSmiles": "She crosses her arms and smiles at you. [say: So you came back huh? Did you want to chat with little old me?] she asks.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.CrossesArmsTaps": "She crosses her arms and taps her fingers on her shoulder. [say: So, why are you here? What do you want?] she asks.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.CuriousHowHolding": "Curious on how Amily is holding up, you head back into the ruined village. This time you don't bother trying to hide your presence, hoping to attract Amily's attention quicker. After all, she did say that the place is basically empty of anyone except her, and you can otherwise handle a measly Imp or Goblin.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.DecideFindHerFirst": "Deciding to find Amily first instead of waiting for her to find you, you set off into the ruins. Using all of your knowledge, skill and cunning to figure out where she is likely to be, you make your way there without giving yourself away.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.DemandsWhyHurt": "Amily looks hurt. [say: Why?] she demands desperately.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.EmbarrassedDropClothes": "Highly embarrassed but unable to think of a way to articulate it, you [if (!isnaked){drop your [armor] and }]let her see the flat and featureless expanse of flesh that is your crotch.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.EnterVillageCautious": "You enter the ruined village cautiously. There are burnt-down houses, smashed-in doorways, ripped-off roofs... everything is covered with dust and grime. You explore for an hour, but you cannot find any sign of another living being, or anything of value. The occasional footprint from an imp or a goblin turns up in the dirt, but you don't see any of the creatures themselves. It looks like time and passing demons have stripped the place bare since it was originally abandoned. Finally, you give up and leave. You feel much easier when you're outside of the village."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.EnterVillageCautiousAgain": "You enter the ruined village cautiously. There are burnt-down houses, smashed-in doorways, ripped-off roofs... everything is covered with dust and grime. For hours you explore, but you cannot find any sign of another living being, or anything of value. The occasional footprint from an imp or a goblin turns up in the dirt, but you don't see any of the creatures themselves. It looks like time and passing demons have stripped the place bare since it was originally abandoned. Finally, you give up and leave. You feel much easier when you're outside of the village--you had the strangest sensation of being watched while you were in there."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.EnterVillageCautiousThird": "You enter the ruined village cautiously. There are burnt-down houses, smashed-in doorways, ripped-off roofs... everything is covered with dust and grime. You explore for an hour, but you cannot find any sign of another living being, or anything of value. The occasional footprint from an imp or a goblin turns up in the dirt, but you don't see any of the creatures themselves. It looks like time and passing demons have stripped the place bare since it was originally abandoned. Finally, you give up and leave. You feel much easier when you're outside of the village - you had the strangest sensation of being watched while you were in there."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.EnterVillageLaughing": "You enter the ruined village, still laughing at your past nefarious deeds. Maybe it's just your imagination, but you feel like this entire place reeks of corruption now... You explore for an hour, then go back to your camp, knowing your tainted slave will be more than happy to satisfy your urges."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ErectionTentsPants": "and the erection tenting her pants "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ExplainNotWoman": "Blushing, you explain to her that you aren't actually a woman. She looks very puzzled at this.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ExplainsRole": "[say: You see, that role I was talking about? I've had a long time to think about it, and there's no one else for it. If there are ever going to be more of my kind born into freedom, they're going to have to be born. Literally; I need to find a mate that is pure, one that can give me strong and pure children of my own kind,] she explains, one hand absently touching her flat belly. [say: The few males of my kind that I've managed to find are demon slaves--far too corrupt to make suitable mates, even if I could free them. I've heard, though, that humans are strangely weak breeders; your seed would be free of taint, and you would father more of my own kind. Unlike, say, an imp or a minotaur.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ExplainsRoleAgain": "[say: You see, that role I was talking about? I've had a long time to think about it, and there's no one else for it. If there are ever going to be more of my kind born into freedom, they're going to have to be born. Literally; I need to find a mate that is pure, one that can give me strong and pure children of my own kind,] she explains, one hand absently touching her flat belly. [say: The few males of my kind that I've managed to find are demon slaves--far too corrupt to make suitable mates, even if I could free them. I've heard, though, that humans are strangely weak breeders; your seed would be free of taint, and you would father more of my own kind. Unlike, say, an imp or a minotaur.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.EyesBugOut": "Amily's eyes bug out, her jaw falls slack and she stares at you, clearly gobsmacked. Then she spits a stream of incoherent, dumbfounded profanities. Finally, she shakes her head. [say: Well... that's a new one. I guess... it makes sense. Damn, just when you thought you'd seen it all. I suppose I should go now,] she tells you and turns to leave.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.FindHerEmerging": "Finally, you find her emerging from a turn-off, pulling up her pants and muttering to herself about her bladder.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.FindHerRummaging": "Finally, you find her rummaging through the contents of a home that has been torn open. She appears to be looking for as many old strips of cloth as she can find.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.FindHerSquatting": "Finally, you find her squatting down in front of a small bush. She's industriously picking it clean of berries, gulping down almost as many as she puts into a small sack at her side.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.GetJobDone": "[say: Well, I guess despite whatever other faults you may have, you can get the job done,] she says, not looking directly at you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.GrinsOpenDelight": "She grins at you with open delight. [saystart]Hey there, [name]! It's great to see you again... "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.GroansSoftlyThanks": "She groans softly. [say: This isn't an easy task, you know. But I still want to thank you. Maybe, when these ones are born, you'll be willing to help me make some more?] she asks, her tail gently waving behind her.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.HearWhimperTrack": "After wondering for a while how on earth you are going to track down Amily, you hear a whistle. Looking around, you see her waving cheekily at you from around a corner; it's pretty obvious that you have a long way to go before you'll be able to beat her at this kind of game.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.HearWhimperTrackAgain": "After wondering for a while how on earth you are going to track down Amily, you hear a whistle. Looking around, you see her waving cheekily at you from around a corner; it's pretty obvious that you have a long way to go before you'll be able to beat her at this kind of game.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.HowApproachHer": "How do you approach her?"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.HowApproachHerAgain": "How do you approach her?"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.LooksThoughtfulStops": "She looks thoughtful. [say: You know...] She begins, but stops and "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.LowersBlowpipe": "She looks at you for a few long moments, and then lowers her blowpipe, [say: I'm sorry about that, but I thought you were another demon. They destroyed this place years ago, but some of the damn scavengers still occasionally drift through. Not so much lately, of course. I've made something of an impression on them.] She grins malevolently, one hand caressing the blade of her knife in an almost sensual fashion. [saystart]My name is Amily, the last survivor of this village. All of my people are gone now; they're scattered, dead, enslaved, or worse. What about you? "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.LowersBlowpipeAgain": "She looks at you for a few long moments, and then lowers her blowpipe, [say: I'm sorry about that, but I thought you were another demon. They destroyed this place years ago, but some of the damn scavengers still occasionally drift through. Not so much lately, of course. I've made something of an impression on them.] She grins malevolently, one hand caressing the blade of her knife in an almost sensual fashion. [saystart]My name is Amily, the last survivor of this village. All of my people are gone now; they're scattered, dead, enslaved, or worse. What about you? "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.LowersBlowpipeFourth": "She looks at you for a few long moments, and then lowers her blowpipe, [say: I'm sorry about that, but I thought you were another demon. They destroyed this place years ago, but some of the damn scavengers still occasionally drift through. Not so much lately, of course. I've made something of an impression on them.] She grins malevolently, one hand caressing the blade of her knife in an almost sensual fashion. [saystart]My name is Amily, the last survivor of this village. All of my people are gone now; they're scattered, dead, enslaved, or worse. What about you? "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.LowersBlowpipeThird": "She looks at you for a few long moments, and then lowers her blowpipe, [say: I'm sorry about that, but I thought you were another demon. They destroyed this place years ago, but some of the damn scavengers still occasionally drift through. Not so much lately, of course. I've made something of an impression on them.] She grins malevolently, one hand caressing the blade of her knife in an almost sensual fashion. [saystart]My name is Amily, the last survivor of this village. All of my people are gone now; they're scattered, dead, enslaved, or worse. What about you? "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.MaterializesQuick": "It doesn't take long for Amily to materialize out of the ruins. Her blowpipe and dagger are both thrust into her belt, and she's still wearing the same tattered clothes as before.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.MaterializesSlow": "Amily materializes out of the ruins somewhat slower than usual. You can see that your efforts together have taken; an undeniable bulge pokes out of her midriff, pushing up her tattered shirt slightly and seriously straining her belt. She idly rubs it with one hand, as if confirming its presence to herself.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.MinutesBeforeAppears": "It takes several minutes before Amily appears, but when you see her, you marvel at how she got to you as quickly as she did. Her stomach is hugely swollen; one of her hands actually cradles underneath its rounded expanse, as if trying to hold it up. She is pants-less, evidently no longer able to fit into them. Her shirt drapes loosely, barely managing to cover the upper half of her firm orb of a belly. The belt where she hangs her blowpipe and dagger has been tied around her upper chest like a sash - between her breasts and her bulge - so she can still carry her weapons effectively.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.MusingDriftsBack": "She continues walking away. After she has vanished, though, another musing drifts back to you. [say: There's also this stuff called Succubus Milk you can do the same thing with, if you want to be a girl.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.NoJokingMatter": "suggests that it's no joking matter.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.OneOfThoseHumans": "one of those... humans, I've heard sometimes wander into this world?[sayend][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.OrGetKnockedUp": " Or have you come to get knocked up?"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.RegainedConfidenceWinks": "Having evidently regained her confidence, she winks and then vanishes behind a tumbled-down wall, leaving you alone."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ScuffsGround": "Amily scuffs the ground with one of her finger-like toe claws, looking down at it as if it was the most interesting thing in the world--or as if she doesn't dare to look you in the eyes. [say: I... You know what I've been asking of you--from you--and you keep turning me down... but you kept talking to me, asking me about myself. You wanted to get to know me, but... why don't you want to know ALL of me? I... I want to give myself to you. You're the nicest, kindest man I've met--even before the demons destroyed my village. I want to be with you... but you don't seem to want to be with me.] She looks up to you at last, her eyes wet with tears. [say: Is there something wrong with me? Can't you like me in that way?] she pleads.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ShakesHeadWistful": "She shakes her head and smiles at you wistfully. [say: Listen to me, rambling. I'm sorry again for attacking you. But, take care out there; there's a lot of freaky monsters that will do the most unspeakable things to a [if (ischild) {girl|woman}] if they can catch her.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ShakesHeadWistfulAgain": "She shakes her head and smiles at you wistfully. [say: Listen to me, rambling. I'm sorry again for attacking you. But, take care out there; there's a lot of freaky monsters that will do the most unspeakable things to a woman if they can catch her.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.SmilesBeatifically": "[say: I should have known you were coming; they always start kicking up a storm when you're here - did you know that?] She smiles beatifically. [say: They know their daddy already, they do. With your help, a new generation of my people will have a chance to grow up free from the taint of demons. Was there something on your mind?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.SmilesSoftlySeeYou": "She smiles softly upon seeing you. [say: It's always good to see somebody else who hasn't given in to corruption. Did you have something on your mind?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.SneakThroughRuins": "Using all of your knowledge, skill and cunning, you sneak and squirm through the ruins until you finally find yourself coming up right behind the dusty mouse girl. She's picking berries off of a small bush and hasn't noticed you yet.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.SniffsAir": "sniffs the air intensely, her whiskers quivering. "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.StaresAtBulges": "stares at the bulge in your top, as well as the bulge in your bottom. "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.StaresIntently": "She stares at you intently, and you ask her what the matter is.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.StaresIntentlyAgain": "She stares at you intently, and you ask her what the matter is.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.StopsBeforeWall": "She stops, however, just before rounding a wall. [say: There's this stuff you'll find in bottles called Incubus Draft. If you drink that, it'll make you a boy--but I'd find an alchemist first, so he can remove the corruption from it.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.StrokesBellyGrinning": "[say: Thank you. With your help, my people will soon live again.] She strokes her belly, grinning happily. [say: Is there something you want to talk about?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.StuffAnotherBun": "Have you come back so I could stuff another bun in your oven?"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.TeasesBodyLanguage": "[sayend] she teases, but her body language "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ThankHerBrushOff": "You thank her, and she brushes it off.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ThankYouExclaims": "[say: Thank you, thank you! I couldn't have done this without you!] she exclaims. [say: You've done a wonderful, noble thing, and I'm glad I found you to be their father. So, not that it isn't great to see you again, but why did you come to visit?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ThoseHumansAgain": "one of those... humans, I've heard sometimes wander into this world?[sayend][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ThoseHumansFourth": "one of those... humans, I've heard sometimes wander into this world?[sayend][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.ThoseHumansThird": "one of those... humans, I've heard sometimes wander into this world?[sayend][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.TucksBlowpipe": "She tucks her blowpipe into her belt and takes several uncertain steps towards you, trying to appear winning--flirtatious even--despite her grimy appearance and clear inexperience with the matter. [say: Please, will you help me? You said something about being a champion--If you lay with me and help me bring more of my people into this world, free of the demons and untouched by their perverse taint, you will be striking another kind of blow against their corrupt stranglehold on Mareth.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.TucksBlowpipeAgain": "She tucks her blowpipe into her belt and takes several uncertain steps towards you, trying to appear winning--flirtatious even--despite her grimy appearance and clear inexperience with the matter. [say: Please, will you help me? You said something about being a champion--if you lay with me and help me bring more of my people into this world, free of the demons and untouched by their perverse taint, you will be striking another kind of blow against their corrupt stranglehold on Mareth.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.VanishesIntoDust": "She turns and walks away, vanishing into the dust and the rubble like magic."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.VoiceCallsWarning": "[say: Don't make any sudden moves!] A voice calls out, high pitched and a little squeaky, but firm and commanding. You freeze to avoid giving your assailant a reason to shoot at you again. [say: Stand up and turn around, slowly,] it commands again. You do as you are told.[pg]"
