  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.WindThroughRuins": "You wind your way deep into the maze of dusty crumbling buildings and twisted saplings, looking for any sign of life--or, failing that, something that can help you in your quest. Bending down to rummage through an old heap of rubbish, you complain aloud that this is hardly the sort of thing you expected to be doing as a champion. Suddenly, you hear a 'thwip' and something shoots past your face, embedding itself into a stone wall near your head, trembling from the impact.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.WindThroughRuinsAgain": "You wind your way deep into the maze of dusty crumbling buildings and twisted saplings, looking for any sign of life--or, failing that, something that can help you in your quest. Bending down to rummage through an old heap of rubbish, you complain aloud that this is hardly the sort of thing you expected to be doing as a champion. Suddenly, you hear a 'thwip' and something shoots past your face, embedding itself into a stone wall near your head, trembling from the impact.[pg]"
