  "Scenes.Amilyscene.EncounterAmily.WinksWandersOff": "[say: Hey, us girls gotta stick together, right?] She winks at you then wanders off behind a partially collapsed wall, disappearing into the rubble."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FarewellNote.AmilyMovedOut": "<b>Amily has moved out!</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FarewellNote.AwakenAmilyGone": "[pg]When you awaken this morning, you find Amily gone and a small message left for you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FarewellNote.MaybeSheHasPoint": " Maybe she had a point though? You are getting pretty corrupt... these thoughts are proof enough.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FarewellNote.PlanNeedsLustDraft": "You begin to formulate a plan, but to put it into motion you'll require a Lust Draft and some Goblin Ale. That damn rat is going to rue the day she denied you..."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FarewellNote.RecallInterestingPotions": "You think about some of the more interesting potions you found while exploring; perhaps you could use some of them..."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FarewellNote.StillCanHelpHer": "So what if you are aren't so pure anymore; you're still very much capable of helping her! Maybe you should teach her a lesson?[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FarewellNote.TriedToWarnYou": "[say: Dear [name], I tried to warn you, but the corruption, it seems, was too strong for even you. I don't want to do this, but I've left the camp--I care too much for the [manboy] you were to see you throw your life into depravity and sin as another demon. If you should manage to turn back from the abyss, then I will come back to you.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FirstTimeAmilyTakeCharge.BigIdeaProtest": "[say: Hey, what's the big idea?] she protests indignantly.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FirstTimeAmilyTakeCharge.CantBeSerious": "[say: You can't be serious!] she protests when she sees what you have hidden in your pants.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FirstTimeAmilyTakeCharge.ClimaxOverPullOut": "Only when you are sure that the last of your climax is over do you pull out, carelessly striding over to retrieve your clothing and start getting dressed. Amily stares at you, her eyes hard and sharp as flints. [say: Was it good for you?] She spits. [say: Let's hope we've both gotten what we want out of this.][pg]"
