  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FirstTimeAmilyTakeCharge.HappyAnytimeNeeds": "You jeer back that you'd be happy to do this anytime she needs, finishing dressing yourself and leaving her without so much as a backwards glance.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FirstTimeAmilyTakeCharge.HipsThrustHarder": "Your hips thrust back and forth, harder and faster as you grow more and more aroused. Her cunt grips you like a vice, and you can feel the warm delicious pressure building up inside you. Stronger and stronger it grows, until you cannot hold it back any more and with a roar let your cum gush out, flooding her as deeply as you can.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FirstTimeAmilyTakeCharge.HorrorDisgustFeatures": "Horror and disgust write themselves on her features as your knobbly, diabolic penis is revealed to her. [say: What kind of monster are you?! You'll kill me with that unholy thing!][pg]"
