  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FirstTimeAmilyTakeCharge.SceneryDoesntMatter": "You decide that the scenery doesn't matter; Amily promised you sex, and you want that sex. Without a word you step forward and give her a mighty push, sending her falling onto her butt with a squeak as you thrust her towards the [say: bed]--that she lands in it is more coincidence than anything. You drop down on top of her, pinning her arms and legs with your own.[pg]"
