  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FirstTimeAmilyTakeCharge.StallionCockShock": "Her eyes go wide with shock and fear as she discovers your stallion-like cock. [say: Even in this world, being hung like a horse isn't a good thing! I can't take something like that!][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.FirstTimeAmilyTakeCharge.ThrustIntoHer": "Without further ado, you thrust into her, eliciting a shriek of equal parts pain and rage. Ignoring that, you focus on trying to squeeze as much as your cock as you can into her warm, tight, velvety depths. She sobs and moans as you struggle, "
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.AffirmationBolsters": "[pg]Your quick affirmation does a good deal to bolster her confidence, and in short order, she's gathering leaves, grass, and mud, making a canvas of her face and body as she makes herself seamlessly blend into the natural surroundings. You [if (cor < 40) {give her a compliment|reward her with some praise}], and her face lights up with a smile, even as she continues molding her disguise. [say:I-It's nothing special. Really, just standard survival stuff...]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.AmilyAgreesSlowly": "[pg][say:Well, if you think so, [name],] she says. [say:I guess it's always just seemed like the same old forest to me, though. I don't know if it'll be very romantic...]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.AssuresEnjoyment": "[pg]You assure her that you enjoyed it all the same, and a little sparkle lights in her eyes. [say:I'm glad, [name].] She looks a bit embarrassed, but continues anyway. [say:I had a great time too. Is... there anything else you'd like to do while we're out here?]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.MakeDoBest": "[pg][say:I make do as best I can,] she replies, looking pensive. As if to banish the thought of her current circumstances, she begins to rush through the proceedings, darting through the forest and showing you little tricks she's picked up here and there, like which mushrooms are edible and which sounds are signs of a nearby tentacle beasts."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.NeedABreather": "[pg]After a while, the two of you find yourselves quite in need of a breather, electing to take shelter in the hollow of a large tree. [say:Well, I'm not sure how much of a date that was,] she says, blushing and curling her tail around her leg. [say:Did you like it?]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.NervousButAgrees": "[pg]She seems slightly nervous for some reason, but agrees nonetheless. [say:Hmm... Okay, [name]. It's a date!]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.PausesSniffingTrees": "[pg]The mouse-[if (nofur) {girl|morph}] pauses for a moment in front of the trees, sniffing the air around you before saying, [say:Alright, just follow my lead.] Her focus is absolute as she picks through branches and twigs like a whisper, [if (spe < 50) {and you struggle|but you manage}] to keep up as she makes her way through the forest."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.ReachClearingRest": "[pg]Before long, you reach a clearing, and Amily takes a moment to rest against a log. [say: I'd usually use a bit of camouflage before going any deeper. Would... Would you like me to show you, [name]?]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.RemarkableNonetheless": "[pg]It's remarkable nonetheless, you tell her, and you never had to do anything like this back in Ingnam. Has she really been living like this all this time?"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.SetOffQuietly": "[pg]The two of you set off towards the wilderness, taking care not to make too much noise, since it would be quite inconvenient for you to be spotted by any demons along the way. During your trek, Amily gives you a surprising number of pointers on how to move stealthily through Mareth's terrain. It's clear that she's put a great deal of thought and practice into getting by unnoticed, and her expertise is evident when you make it to the treeline without a single bit of trouble."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.SharesHerExperience": "[pg]Well, perhaps she can give you a better idea of her experience with it. You're an outsider, and her perspective could give you some valuable insight into how to survive in this place. And any time you spend with her is special regardless."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDate.SuggestForestTrip": "You suggest to Amily that a trip into the forest might be a nice change of pace. After all, she's been living here in Mareth for far longer than you have, so it might be nice for her to show you around a bit. At your suggestion, she gives a slight smile, her tail swishing eagerly behind her."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.AsksWhatSheMeans": "You ask her what exactly she has in mind, and a blush blooms [if (nofur) {on her face|through her fur}]."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.BackToCampAgain": "[pg][say:We should... get back to camp, [name]. Um. But... we need to do this again sometime.]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.ButTheresNo": "[pg][say:But there's no--]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.CutsHerOffAsking": "[pg]You cut her off by asking if she wants to [if (cor > 40) {fuck you|get intimate}]. Amily's shocked expression belies a telling hint of shame, and so you go on to say that you'd be happy to please her anywhere she wants, even in the middle of the forest. In fact, you can't wait."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.GuidesHandToAss": "[pg]Your [if (isgenderless) {[hands] guide one of hers to your [asshole] before making their way over to her entrance|sex hovers right next to the mouse's, and a few preparatory strokes is all you give her before you [if (hascock) {plunge inside|thrust against her}]}], getting a muffled \"eep\" in return. Your motions are slow and probing at first, but it quickly becomes clear that Amily is [if (lib < 50) {just|nearly}] as ravenous as you, which she shows you by mirroring your motions with zeal, her hips rocking in tune with yours and her eyes ablaze with lust."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.HaahExhale": "[pg][say:Haah...]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.IncompleteConfirmation": "[pg]It's not a complete thought, but it's more than enough confirmation. You [if (!isnaked) {strip down and }]present your [genitalsdetail] in a smooth motion, and Amily's gaze is glued to the contours of your body. It's abundantly clear that she's up for this, despite the fervent blush on her face, so you press forward, pulling her body into yours."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.MaraeYesMoan": "[pg][say:Oh, Marae, yes, ah!]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.NoTimeForProtest": "[pg]You don't give her one more second to keep wasting breath on protestations, when in short order she'll be needing all the oxygen she can get. Your lips find hers with a fiery passion that quenches and quells any further doubt she might have had, and by the time you're done with the kiss, her tense limbs have slackened, and her big, pink eyes gaze up at you with a hazy look."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.PleadingCumForMe": "[pg][say:P-Please cum. Please, [name], c-cum for me.]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.PulsesInsideHer": "[pg][if (hascock) {Your [cock] pulses and pulses inside of her, [if (cumnormal) {though you can't quite fill her up|filling her to the brim[if (cumhighleast) { and beyond}]}]|[if (hasvagina) {Your [vagina] pulses rhythmically, pressing as tightly as it can against her entrance[if (vaginalwetness > 2) {, though your copious fluids make it a somewhat slippery affair| in a lewd kiss}]|Your ass starts to clench around her fingers as your entire core radiates with carnal release, despite your lack of sex}]}], and her pleasure is just as clear by the way she squirms around you. You don't let up for the entire duration of your orgasm, writhing and gasping against Amily with complete abandon, and it's only when your limbs no longer want to obey your command that you finally stop moving, the sounds of you and your lover's breaths the only thing audible in the clearing."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.QuietAlmostWhisper": "[pg]The words are so quiet, almost a whisper, but before she can finish repeating them again, you've already tightened your arms around her and moaned your love into her shoulder, your entire body shuddering as you let go. The sweaty tangle of you and Amily becomes one, and you give fully into climax."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.RegainsComposure": "[pg]The mouse manages to regain her composure before you do, sliding out from beneath your body with as much grace as she can manage. She's oddly silent as she smoothes over the [amilyclothing] that got ruffled in your romp, but the look on her face certainly screams \"satisfaction\"."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.RightHereCertain": "[pg]Right here."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.RightHereQuestion": "[pg][say:R-Right here?]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.SlumpsToTheGround": "[pg]Still, there's far more you'd like to be doing to her. You slump to the ground as gently as possible, but any discomfort is quite easy to ignore with such an eager lover beneath you. Amily claws at your shoulders with her nails, [if (tallness > 60) {wraps her legs around your waist|intertwines her legs with your[if (singleleg) { [legs]|s}]}] and nearly shrieks into your [ear] as you speed your movements up to a frenzied pace. Your little mouse is more than wet enough to make the going smooth, though your passion still threatens to outstrip her."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.SurprisingConfidence": "[pg]The last sentiment is expressed with a surprising degree of confidence, so you respond in kind, and the two of you set off into the forest once more, a little more worn out than you'd expected to be on the journey here."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.SweetSoundsBrink": "[pg]Such sweet sounds bring you even closer to the brink, but before you finish, you plan to--"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateFuck.UncertainStammer": "[pg][say:U-Uh, well, I was... I just wasn't sure if there might be some--]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateGather.ClaspHandsThenLeave": "[pg]The two of you clasp hands for a moment before it's time to start back towards camp. Hopefully you'll find some use in what you gathered here today."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateGather.HerbOveruseTangent": "[pg]She's just getting into a tangent about how her mother used to overuse some herb when she catches the look on your face and just smiles back. [say:Alright, I guess that's probably enough for now. It was nice to go through all that, you really do forget how much there is in the world without someone to share it with.]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateGather.InterestInAlchemy": "[pg][say:Oh, definitely,] she responds. [say:I've always had a bit of an interest in alchemy, and I've also had to make do with a few less than pleasant meals ever since... Well, if you really want, I'd love to show you a few things.]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateGather.NodsThenExplains": "[pg]You nod your assent, and the mouse-[if (nofur) {girl|morph}] eagerly dives into an explanation of the various kinds of forest fauna around you. There are tips on which mushrooms are safe to eat, which little sprigs have surprising curative properties, and which vines might leave you with an inconvenient rash, and by the end of it, you find yourself [if (cor < 40) {humbled|surprised}] by just how much you didn't know."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateGather.StillMoreToTeach": "Amily has already shown you a lot about the forest, but perhaps she still has more to teach. You ask her if she's picked up any skills relating to foraging in the time that she's had to fend for herself; she's certainly demonstrated a remarkable ability to adapt."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateKiss.AcheFadingRelief": "[pg]It's less a shock and more the sensation of an intense ache fading away. Palpable relief swirls and mixes with the pure sense of closeness, and you feel yourself melt just a bit, lost in her lips. All of the feelings you've had for Amily, all of the experiences you've had together, and everything you've wanted to say to her seem to merge together into this one expression of love, one that stretches on for what could easily be eternity."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ForestDateKiss.BarelyConsciousMove": "[pg]You're barely conscious of your own movements at this point, but your surroundings don't matter very much to you, because in the next moment, your [face] is right next to hers, close enough to feel the warmth radiating from her [if (nofur) {skin|fur}]. She lets out a slight murmur, but seems to have no more words than you right now, so you lean in and seal the deal."
