  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.FoolsLivingFoolsLife": "[say: Fools... That's what we were. We were fools living a fool's life. Back then the only thing that got inside the village was imps, and we, like the fools we were, believed we were safe. Haha, I feel like laughing, just remembering all this. It's no wonder my village fell the way it did... And I don't miss it; not for one instant. I'm much too happy here as your loyal cumslut, {0}. You saved me from a boring life as a villager, so I could live a glorious existence as a cumdumpster for you... Thank you, [master],] Amily says, smiling at you adoringly.[pg]"
