  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.HowSheFoundOut": "You ask her how she found out so much about the Sand Witches. She smiles and says, [say: I got lost in the desert once. A sand witch approached me and asked me if I would let her cast a spell on me. When I refused, she attacked, trying to beat me down so she could cast it on me anyway.][pg]"
