  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.HypnoticThrumming": "[say: Well {0}, they mainly use this hypnotic thrumming from their wings; but someone as sharp and wise as you should have no problem shrugging it off. They aren't the kind to get violent; they will ask you to accept their eggs, if you resist their hypnosis, but they won't try to beat you into submission so they can lay their eggs. I wouldn't ever fight them; they're quick and pretty tough, thanks to that armor, and they've got this strange venom that saps your strength and arouses you at the same time. But I'm sure you wouldn't have any problems dealing with them [master]. If you ever fight one, get some of their honey; and if you get dirty while doing it, I'd be happy to give you a tongue bath until you're clean,] Amily says, slowly licking her lips from side to side.[pg]"
