  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.ImpsWeakSmall": "[say: Imps,] Amily says. [say: They're weak and small, easy to cut down. They're also all over the place, looking to rape anything they can get their hands on; they can also use some black magic to get you horny. I used to kill them all the time, but there was always more.] Amily smiles a bit. [say: They have big cocks as well, I wouldn't mind having a cock that big inside me,] she says, her eyes slowly moving towards your crotch.[pg]"
