  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.LovesKnockedUp": "She looks to you pleadingly and says, [saystart]I love getting knocked up too, {0}. I could birth you many mice to worship you like you deserve; and then we could all fuck. Oh, [master]!"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.MilkProducingSlave": "[say: I don't know... Maybe make me into some kind of milk-producing slave? That wouldn't do... if I became their slave I would never have been able to become your slave, [master],] she responds, grinning at you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.MinotaurRutting": "[say: Oh, they may not look corrupted, but all they care about is finding something to rut with--man, woman, both, neither, they don't care. So long as it's got a hole, they'll fuck it... I think maybe I heard somewhere that they can only reproduce by raping other creatures with a vagina now, but I don't remember where,] she says, tapping her chin in thought.[pg]"
