  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.MotherWasHunter": "[say: She was a hunter, one of the best I think... Quick enough to run a deer to ground, quiet enough that it wouldn't know she was there until her knife was at its throat, skilled enough with a blowpipe to pin a fly to a tree from fifty paces without killing it,] Amily says, not without a hint of pride. [say: Of course, in the end that didn't help her at all. I mean... She taught me all she knew, and people used to say I was going to be just like her when I grew up; yet, I got caught. Thankfully it was you who caught me, {0}. I couldn't imagine myself as anyone else's sexy mouse pet fucktoy. I love you, [master]!] she suddenly exclaims, throwing herself at you, hugging your waist and nuzzling your crotch affectionately.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.NoMalesLeft": "Amily looks pensive, trying to recall something. [say: I don't think they have any males left, but on very rare occasions I've seen these weird tiger-striped shark-girls.] Her tail begins moving from side to side, moisture beginning to drip from her. [say: They have these huge cock and huge balls, and the only thing they care about is fighting and fucking. I think both things are the same for them,] she says, panting a bit.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.NobodyBeforeYou": "[say: Who was I? Well, [master]... Before you saved me, I was nobody, really. Just an average little girl, a face in the crowd. My father was an alchemist; he made a lot of his money in those days working to purify items that were tainted in some fashion, but his primary goal was trying to come up with a concoction that could actually help purify someone who had been tainted already. What a fool; It's no wonder he never did succeed,] Amily mocks.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.NotExactlyDemons": "[say: Well, they're not exactly demons, I guess, but they do have some similarities. For some reason, they're really resistant to being corrupted, though,] she says, frowning slightly. [say: I'm sure you'd have no problems doing it though, [master]. From the tales I've heard, they were already like that waaay before the demons came along,] she explains. You take a moment to think about this, and then gesture for her to continue. [say: Their magic is like... really strong. I'm sure someone as great as you wouldn't have any problems dealing with it though,] she says in a deeply flattering tone. [say: I think they get their power from living things. They can get it in lots of ways, but I guess their favorite way is through fucking,] she says, drooling a little. [say: Mmm... Just thinking about it is making me wanna fuck.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.NotPickedBest": "[say: Of course... That would mean I wouldn't have been picked by the best of the lot.] Amily hugs your waist and looks up at you adoringly. [say: I'm so glad it's you who got me, {0},] she says, lightly nuzzling your crotch. You smile at her and pat her on her head. You tell her that later you'll see about reenacting the invasion of her village, only this time she'll get caught. Amily lights up and giddily says, [say: I can't wait for it [master]!] You chuckle and leave her to her own devices.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.NuzzlesYourCrotch": "She leans forward a bit, approaching your crotch. You smile and nod; she nuzzles your crotch affectionately, until you push her back. You ask her if she knows anything more.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.OfficialNameGiantBees": "[say: Well... the Giant Bees you've probably seen [master]... the official name for them is the fertile caste, but folks tend to just call them handmaidens,] Amily explains.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.PatHeadGoodGirl": "You step closer and pat her head approvingly, telling her she's a good girl. Amily takes the opportunity to nuzzle your crotch affectionately. Then you dismiss her with a wave.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.PatHeadNuzzle": "You approach her and pat her head, allowing her to nuzzle your crotch lovingly. You tell her not to worry; you will fuck her much more in the future. [say: Cum-pet can't wait for that, [master],] she replies. You dismiss her with a wave.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.PausesAnotherFact": "She pauses for a moment, and then speaks up with another interesting fact in an attempt to please you. [say: They do seem to have a strange fascination with tentacle beasts, for some reason. Oooh just thinking about it gets me so horny! Please [master], fuck me? Please, oh please!][pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.PigtailTruffle": "[say: That's a pigtail truffle,] Amily says, [say: It might give you pig ears and even tail! It would make you plump and cute-looking, [master],] she giggles.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.PleaseKnockMeUp": " Can you please knock me up? I don't care how, just order me to fuck until I get pregnant."
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.PraiseUntouched": "[say: It doesn't surprise me in the least you got away untouched, [master],] Amily says flatteringly. [say: Minotaurs are dangerous brutes--they're one of the biggest, strongest and toughest beasts around. I don't dare go near the mountains, not with those things roaming around. Sometimes they carry around huge axes, but most just make do with their fists,] she explains.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.PureBeeHoney": "[say: You managed to get your hands on ultra-pure giant bee honey?] she asks, sounding impressed. [say: I hear that stuff's so pure it can actually help purge the eater of demonic taint--but why would you want to do that?] she asks mockingly.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.PushAwaySorry": "You pat her head, and then push her away. She settles herself back on her knees. [say: Sorry about that, [master],] she says, a bit ashamed of her little outburst. You ask her what the fate of her parents was.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.RanToHouse": "[say: Well {0}... I ran as fast as I could to my house. I wanted to get my hunting knife and blowpipe. Useless tools... But back then I was a fool too,] she explains. [say: Then my parents showed up and told me to run. I didn't want to, but I obeyed... I was so scared... Don't know why, though? It's just sex... Wonderful, sweaty, slimy, creamy sex,] she says dreamily, licking her lips and shooting you a seductive grin. You tell her that you'll think about some way to reward her later. [say: I kept running as fast as I could, until I couldn't run anymore; then I hid and stayed hidden through the whole night. I only woke up in the morning, and I was ravenous, so I foraged something to eat and went back to the village. That's when I saw it was in ruins... I was lost and my life was in shambles... Thankfully, you eventually showed up to save me and pick up the pieces, [master],] she says adoringly.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.RecallsAttack": "She closes her eyes and rubs her chin, attempting to recall every little detail of the attack. [say: It was the evening of a festival... Everyone was in the town square celebrating something stupid like the years harvest. Typical country mouse stuff,] Amily says with disdain. [say: Anyways; the demons managed to break in through the gate and over the walls. It's kind of stupid if you think about it [master]. Demons have wings... Who is the genius that thought walls would hold them back?] Amily mocks. [say: And you know what's even more funny? We had sentries, but those fools were at the festival too!] Amily bursts out laughing. You chuckle and tell her to carry on.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.RememberPocketItem": "You remember that you have something in your pockets that might be of interest, and show it to Amily.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.SandWitchTales": "You decide to talk to Amily about the adventures she's had when she was still adventuring. From there the topic drifts to the mysterious female magic-users you've seen in the Desert.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Amilyscene.TalkWithCORRUPTCUNT.SandWitches": "[say: Sand witches? They are human-like magic users, but they aren't truly humans, and to my knowledge they aren't demons either... Forgive me, [master], but this useless fucktoy of yours doesn't know for sure,] she says, looking down. [say: I think that they might be some kind of druidic sect. Restoring life to the desert, trying to make it into grassland or something like that,] Amily adds.[pg]"
