  "Scenes.Amilyscene.ThisFunctionProbablySucksTooOhYeahAmilyFunction.CameToLoveYou": "But as I got to know you, you became more to me. I love you, [name], and I don't want to leave you. You came to this world on a quest, didn't you? Well, you helped me with my quest, so it's only fair I help you with yours. The children have been taught well, they can make their own way from here and now... but I want to come back with you, to stay with you and help however I can. Will you let me?"
